E5 split runs: --phase prefix / branch (--prefix-run, --branches) and --resume-from an interrupted run's prefix store; a failed unit stays failed on a resumed ingest; resumed runs count ingested and failed units from the store and report no prefix cost; offline tests check that split runs reproduce one run and that a resume adds nothing twice; decision row

